---
import Simple from '../layouts/Simple.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Simple title="Privacy Policy | Final Touch Fencing" h1="Privacy policy" label="Privacy Policy" path="/privacy/" description="How Final Touch Fencing LLC collects and uses information submitted through this website." lede="Last updated October 7, 2026">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you request a quote, we collect what you enter in the form: your name, phone number, ZIP code and any optional details (email, address, project information). We also record the page you submitted from and, if you arrived from an ad or campaign link, the campaign tags in that link (for example <code>utm_source</code>). This tells us how people find us.</p>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use your information only to respond to your request, prepare an estimate and communicate about your project. We don’t sell or rent your information.</p>
  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>Form submissions are delivered to us by email through our website host and an email delivery service. Spam protection may be provided by Cloudflare Turnstile. If analytics are enabled on this site (such as Google Analytics through Google Tag Manager), those services may set cookies to measure site usage. You can block cookies in your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>We keep quote requests as long as needed to respond and keep reasonable business records.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or requests about your information: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>
</Simple>
